OL,6,     FMillions of Brazilians have become
OL,7,     Fproblem gamblers after an
OL,8,     Fexplosion in online betting - with
OL,9,     Fa particularly big increase in
OL,10,     Fwomen seeking help for betting
OL,11,     Fproblems.
