OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FZayd Ayers Dohrn grew up in an
OL,17,     Funderground world of secrecy. His
OL,18,     Fparents were leading a violent
OL,19,     Fmovement which planted bombs,
OL,20,     Frobbed banks, and broke militants
OL,21,     Fout of jail.
